1
00:00:49,383 --> 00:00:51,949
Here is VibroVision working.

2
00:00:51,899 --> 00:00:58,690
An ordinary video becomes a measurement of motion, inspectable
evidence, and a clear next step.

3
00:01:00,283 --> 00:01:05,568
We start with two recordings of the same fan, without a coin and
with a coin.

4
00:01:05,518 --> 00:01:09,410
These are real source videos, not an animation.

5
00:01:10,983 --> 00:01:15,430
OpenCV follows the fan housing and a background reference.

6
00:01:15,380 --> 00:01:21,076
Subtracting camera motion helps separate the machine's movement from
movement of the camera.

7
00:01:21,076 --> 00:01:24,762
Small changes are measured across many frames.

8
00:01:26,350 --> 00:01:30,217
Spectral analysis separates motion into rhythms.

9
00:01:30,167 --> 00:01:34,201
Averaging short-window spectra reduces variability.

10
00:01:34,201 --> 00:01:40,309
A peak shows repeating motion; the frame rate limits which
frequencies the video can resolve.

11
00:01:41,883 --> 00:01:47,980
In this run on AWS, tone amplitude changed by about thirty six
times.

12
00:01:47,930 --> 00:01:51,152
That is a difference between these recordings.

13
00:01:51,152 --> 00:01:54,386
It does not identify a damaged bearing.

14
00:01:55,983 --> 00:02:01,912
Two parts can shake equally strongly, yet move together or in
opposite directions.

15
00:02:01,862 --> 00:02:05,264
Separate power spectra can look identical.

16
00:02:05,264 --> 00:02:09,530
The joint spectral matrix keeps that timing relationship.

17
00:02:09,530 --> 00:02:13,770
Its eigenvectors describe coordinated patterns of motion.

18
00:02:15,350 --> 00:02:20,570
We connect those patterns to a model of mass, damping, and
stiffness.

19
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:26,306
Only compatible observations support estimating the couplings
between visible parts.

20
00:02:26,306 --> 00:02:30,598
Unknown forcing can still prevent a structural diagnosis.

21
00:02:32,183 --> 00:02:35,831
A close-up can double one part's apparent motion.

22
00:02:35,781 --> 00:02:42,714
Under the mechanical model, multiplying reciprocal couplings cancels
fixed, positive image scales.

23
00:02:42,714 --> 00:02:45,910
The recovered operator stays the same.

24
00:02:45,910 --> 00:02:52,702
This protects a structural comparison from scale changes; it does
not recover calibrated forces.

25
00:02:54,283 --> 00:02:59,181
The operator's eigenvalues describe squared natural frequencies.

26
00:02:59,131 --> 00:03:02,830
Its eigenvectors describe natural mode shapes.

27
00:03:02,830 --> 00:03:05,768
These connect motion to mechanics.

28
00:03:05,768 --> 00:03:11,928
Recovering the operator requires enough observable modes, not just
one spectral peak.

29
00:03:13,516 --> 00:03:17,423
We compare each change with estimated uncertainty.

30
00:03:17,373 --> 00:03:21,548
If they overlap, we collect more evidence or abstain.

31
00:03:21,548 --> 00:03:28,494
A clearly resolved change can support further localization, provided
the other physical checks pass.

32
00:03:28,494 --> 00:03:33,571
Bootstrap estimates are empirical, not guaranteed confidence bounds.

33
00:03:35,150 --> 00:03:45,125
The inspection agent uses measurements to choose what happens next:
improve a region, gather a longer window, create evidence, or ask
for review.

34
00:03:45,075 --> 00:03:48,748
This trace comes from a controlled synthetic test.

35
00:03:50,316 --> 00:03:57,122
When the footage is too short, unstable, or inconsistent, the system
can withhold a diagnosis.

36
00:03:57,072 --> 00:04:01,273
A person reviews the evidence before approving a work order.

37
00:04:02,850 --> 00:04:06,949
OpenCV five runs on AWS Graviton.

38
00:04:06,899 --> 00:04:10,765
CloudFront provides HTTPS access.

39
00:04:10,765 --> 00:04:15,572
Private S three stores evidence, and CloudWatch records what
happened.

40
00:04:17,150 --> 00:04:21,404
The same analysis runs in the Drive-based Colab notebook.

41
00:04:21,354 --> 00:04:25,439
Sixty automated tests complement the demonstration.

42
00:04:25,439 --> 00:04:27,410
Camera footage.

43
00:04:27,410 --> 00:04:29,769
Mathematical checks.

44
00:04:29,769 --> 00:04:32,153
Inspectable evidence.
